# LMS

Product name is **LMS**. Entry: **https://larisid.com/lms/**.

Formerly referred to as Anton’s app, Anton’s school, or Obrolan Marketing. Use **LMS** in docs, comments aimed at agents, and chat. Keep `obrolan.marketing/` and Contabo `anton-school` only as path/service names.

Cursor home for LMS notes: **[`.cursor/lms/`](../lms/README.md)**. Full product doc: **[docs/lms.md](../../docs/lms.md)**.

- Landing/auth: `lms/` → `/lms/`
- Live class UI: `obrolan.marketing/` → `/s/{slug}/`
- After Contabo login, open the left-rail class app — not the Contabo “Kelas / Edit kurikulum” shell
- No public `?k=` media share pattern
- Deploy: `deploy-static.sh` + `deploy-school-api.sh`; SQL via `apply-selfhost.sh` only
